cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use SMard Agent Flow or its method documents, please cite it with the
  metadata below. An ABNT NBR 6023 reference is in the README, section
  "How to cite".
type: software
title: "SMard Agent Flow: from discomfort to production"
abstract: >-
  A human-led software workflow for the age of autonomous coding agents. It
  accompanies a person from a discomfort that still has no language to the
  observed effects of real software in use, and connects creative exploration
  to spec-driven and task-driven execution without replacing the executor.
